# Shaking Egg (the Condor Hatchling) from Lord Condar in Loch Modan (new in
# Forever).
# Sources: Forever's item data, item 282637 (Lord Condar, 0.2% in 475 kills);
# npcs.json (Lord Condar's four spots); Forever client 1.60.1.70532 (item
# 282637, Summon Condor Hatchling).
# ASSUMED: Lord Condar comes back about four hours after a kill, at one of his
# four spots (Classic flow; the TDB's 14400-second respawn is Classic data).
# In-game check: how often he is up on one layer.

step Lord Condar
  tip Lord Condar is a rare level 15-16 condor in south-eastern Loch Modan. He appears at one of four spots, hours after he last died; the arrow takes you round them. He drops the Shaking Egg only about once in 500 kills, so this is a pet for players who pass through Loch Modan often: check his spots each time, and kill him whenever you see him.
  loop
  goto 77.7,74.9
  goto 74.6,70.8
  goto 74.7,66.9
  goto 62.6,78.5
  collect 282637 "Shaking Egg" -- Lord Condar
